-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\\cap M^2\">\\(\\in\\cap M^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S\\)</span> is the definable-subset predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a63c990f1580982\" href=\"?note=9a63c990f1580982\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-definable.md\">../batch01/58-df-definable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S(M,A)\\leftrightarrow M\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S\\bigl(A,\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M),\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}definable\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4DefinableSubset}_S(M,A)\\leftrightarrow M\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S\\bigl(A,\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M),\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a63c990f1580982","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[.